Data shipped in this repository
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Human Phenotype Ontology (hpo.jax.org), release 2026-09-01
  nextjs-frontend/lib/rare-disease/data/hpo-index.json is compiled from
  hp.obo, phenotype.hpoa and genes_to_disease.txt. HPO is used under its
  license (hpo.jax.org/license), which requires attribution and the release
  version. Please cite: Gargano et al., The Human Phenotype Ontology in 2024,
  Nucleic Acids Research 52(D1), 2024.

GA4GH phenopacket-store 0.1.27 (github.com/monarch-initiative/phenopacket-store)
  The benchmark cases in nextjs-frontend/scripts/rare-disease-eval/ are derived
  from it. BSD 3-Clause License.

Ensembl VEP annotations (ensembl.org)
  nextjs-frontend/lib/rare-disease/data/vep-snapshot.json caches VEP REST
  responses for 417 benchmark and demo variants. They include fields from
  gnomAD, ClinVar, AlphaMissense and CADD. AlphaMissense predictions and CADD
  scores carry non-commercial terms from their providers: check those terms
  before any commercial reuse of the snapshot.

Research use only. Nothing in this repository is a medical device or gives
